CUIDT2,	XX	/DISPLAY THE TIME FROM WHAT IS IN THE AC.
/		THE FORMAT IS IN MINUTES AND IS DISPLAYED IN HOURS AND MINUTES.
/	the elapsed time is given in minutes and is to be taken to be a positive/M013
