CUITLN,	XX	/DISPLAY THE IOA TEXT STRINGS THAT ARE PASSED
/	TO IT BY ARGUMENTS BY THE CALLER. THE NEXT ARGUMENT TELLS WHERE
/	HORIZONTALLY TO MOVE AFTER THE DISPLAY. TO MAKE THE DOCUMENT APPEAR THE SAME
/	A TAB HAS TO BE INSERTED INTO THE DOCUMENT INSTEAD OF THE MOVE IF THE
/	DOCUMENT OPTION IS BEING USED.
