	ISZ	CUITLN	/Increment the col pointer
	SNA
	JMP I	CUITLN	/If col is Zero then exit
	DCA	CUITL2	/Otherwise store the column position
	JMS	CUIPOS	/Position the cursor or make tabs in document
CUITL2,		0	/column position
	JMP	CUITLP	/Loop for next argument set
